#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/firmware-source-code-and-binaries.rst:14
#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/firmware-source-code-and-binaries.rst:32
msgid ""
"Please refer to the :download:`Programming Guide <dl/CMUcam4-Programming-"
"Guide-102.pdf>` for more information."
msgstr ""
"Vă rugăm să consultați :download:`Ghidul de programare "
"<dl/CMUcam4-Programming-Guide-102.pdf>` pentru mai multe informații."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/firmware-source-code-and-binaries.rst:18
msgid ""
"**NOTE:** The CMUcam4 is not programmed in C. It is programmed in a \"C "
"like\" language called \"SPIN\", *lo siento*. For more information please "
"see the P8X32A Propeller Chip Information section below."
msgstr ""
"**NOTĂ:** CMUcam4 nu este programat în C. Este programat într-un limbaj "
"\"asemănător cu C\" numit \"SPIN\", *lo siento*. Pentru mai multe "
"informații, consultați secțiunea de informații despre cipul Propeller P8X32A"
" de mai jos."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam4/firmware-source-code-and-binaries.rst:22
msgid ""
"Additionally, for more information about the *Full File System Driver*, "
"included with the source code, please click `here "
"<http://www.parallaxsemiconductor.com/an006/>`__."
msgstr ""
"În plus, pentru mai multe informații despre *Full File System Driver*, "
"inclus cu codul sursă, faceți clic `aici "
"<http://www.parallaxsemiconductor.com/an006/>`__."

